OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely fine, but chilly start.
OL,6,FMost parts staying dry with sunny
OL,7,Fspells, but also occasional cloudier
OL,8,Fperiods, with the odd shower
OL,9,Fdeveloping. These most likely across
OL,10,Fthe Pennines and perhaps the far
OL,11,Fsouth. Temperatures near normal for
OL,12,FOctober.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA clear, chilly evening,
OL,15,Fbefore cloud thickens from the
OL,16,Fsouthwest overnight. Perhaps the odd
OL,17,Ffrost patch. Winds strengthening for a
OL,18,Ftime after midnight, especially along
OL,19,Fcoasts, with rain spreading north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
