OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FWet start, with rain clearing
OL,6,Fnorth. While some drier intervals
OL,7,Ffollow, further outbreaks of rain are
OL,8,Falso likely, heavy at times. Turning
OL,9,Fdrier from the west later. Winds also
OL,10,Fstrengthening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FChilly
OL,13,Fstart Saturday, but turning wet and
OL,14,Fwindy with rain spreading east. Windy
OL,15,FSunday with showers and brighter
OL,16,Fintervals. Briefly drier overnight,
OL,17,Fbefore further rain and stronger winds
OL,18,Ffollow Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
